/**
 * NAMI CMS — News & Notices
 *
 * Requires the "NAMI CMS — Core engine" snippet, version 1.2.0 or later
 * (collections). Adds a "Notices" menu:
 *   - All Notices / Add New: each notice, event, news item or press release.
 *     They appear on the News & Notices page, the home page and each
 *     institution's notice board.
 *   - Page: …: the text of the /notices page itself.
 *
 * Field keys must match src/lib/cms/pages/notices/types.ts in the Next.js project.
 * The JSON blocks at the bottom are generated by `npm run cms:defaults`.
 */

